   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "\u2022 Other internal services could use the same STS and gateway later,\n   after review\n\u2022 Automation for users with nowhere to run scheduled tasks\n\u2022 Code review is the largest expected benefit to engineers\n\u2022 Later MR comments and agent fixes, on the same identity base\n\u2022 Usage visibility through SIEM metadata and provider records",
   "originalText": "\u2022 Other internal services could use the same STS and gateway later,\n   after review\n\u2022 Automation for users with nowhere to run scheduled tasks\n\u2022 Code review is the largest expected benefit to engineers\n\u2022 Later MR comments and agent fixes, on the same identity base\n\u2022 Usage visibility through SIEM metadata and provider records",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
