   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "\u2022 Accreditor could refuse sign-off, which blocks production\n\u2022 Probe could show no usable identity mapping, which blocks the\n   build\n\u2022 GitLab admins are in the trust boundary and outside the owner's\n   team\n\u2022 Poisoned code runs as whoever triggers it, for up to the token\n   lifetime\n\u2022 Demand for bulk use could overload a service not designed for it",
   "originalText": "\u2022 Accreditor could refuse sign-off, which blocks production\n\u2022 Probe could show no usable identity mapping, which blocks the\n   build\n\u2022 GitLab admins are in the trust boundary and outside the owner's\n   team\n\u2022 Poisoned code runs as whoever triggers it, for up to the token\n   lifetime\n\u2022 Demand for bulk use could overload a service not designed for it",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
